{"lang":"es","dir":"ltr","title":"Chateau Barber Shop | Barbería sin cita en el centro de Napa, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Ir al contenido</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span><span>Chateau Barber Shop</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Nosotros</a><a href=\"#services\">Servicios</a><a href=\"#team\">Barberos</a><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntas</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Fotos</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Reseñas</a><a href=\"#visit\">Horario y ubicación</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Idioma\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\" selected>Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">Llamar</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Barbería · Centro de Napa · Desde 2005</p>\n    <h1>Chateau Barber Shop</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">La barbería sin cita del centro de Napa. Cortes de precisión, barbas y trabajo con navaja, por orden de llegada.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · 122 reseñas en Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama a la barbería</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%2C%201521%203rd%20St%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Cómo llegar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>20 años en Third St</li><li>Sin cita, por orden de llegada</li><li>Solo efectivo</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.9★ de 122 reseñas</a></li><li>Centro de Napa</li><li>Accesible en silla de ruedas</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Nuestra historia</p><h2>Veinte años de cortes y camaradería.</h2><p>La dueña, Santysouk &quot;San&quot; Yankee, es originaria de Laos, donde aprendió a cortar y peinar el cabello de los hombres y tuvo su propio salón. Llegó a EE. UU. en 2001, estudió en una escuela de barbería en Sacramento y, con el apoyo de su difunto esposo, abrió Chateau Barber Shop en junio de 2005 en 1521 Third St., donde antes estaba Phil&#39;s Barber Shop.</p><p>Veinte años después, es una de las barberías principales de Napa, con filas hasta la puerta y clientes fieles que vienen de Sonoma, Vallejo y hasta San Francisco. Las especialidades son los cortes de precisión, las barbas, el afeitado con navaja y los delineados. Sin citas: entra, toma asiento y forma parte de la familia.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>122 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>20 años</b><span>En Third St</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2005</b><span>San abre la barbería</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Interior de Chateau Barber Shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Especialidades</p><h2>Lo que hacemos</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Corte estándar</h3><span class=\"price\">$35</span></div><p>Cortes de precisión, cortes clásicos de caballero y las últimas tendencias.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Niños (10 años o menos) y adultos mayores (65+)</h3><span class=\"price\">$25</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Barbas</h3></div><p>Recorte y arreglo de barba.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Afeitado con navaja</h3></div><p>Afeitado clásico con navaja y toalla caliente.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Delineado</h3></div><p>Líneas y contornos limpios con navaja.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">No publicamos una lista de precios en línea. Solo efectivo. Llama al (707) 255-7662 si tienes preguntas.</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">El equipo</p><h2>Detrás de la silla</h2><p>Pregunta por San o toma la siguiente silla disponible.</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</div><div><h3>San</h3><p>Santysouk Yankee · Dueña desde 2005</p></div></div><p class=\"member-bio\">Originaria de Laos, San perfeccionó su oficio allá antes de emigrar en 2001. El 90% de sus clientes regresan cada semana o cada mes.</p></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Servicios y políticas</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Solo sin cita</b><span>Por orden de llegada. No damos citas</span></li><li><b>Solo efectivo</b></li><li><b>Accesible en silla de ruedas</b></li><li><b>Estacionamiento en la calle y en un lote</b><span>Entre Church St/4th St y School St</span></li><li><b>Ideal para niños</b><span>Los niños escogen una paleta</span></li><li><b>Comida al lado</b><span>Winston’s está justo al lado</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>En el Chateau</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Fachada de Chateau Barber Shop con su poste de barbero\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"Clásico con raya al lado\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Sillas de barbero y fotos enmarcadas\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fresh-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Corte fresco, de frente y de lado\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/logo-sign.jpg\" alt=\"Letrero de Chateau Barber Shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/before-after.jpg\" alt=\"Antes y después del corte\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chairs.jpg\" alt=\"Interior de la barbería\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Corte corto clásico\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">En las noticias</p><h2>San en sus propias palabras</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“My business has grown tremendously from initially being an unknown barbershop with just myself cutting hair to being one of the main barbershops in Napa. Through excellent customer reviews and word of mouth, I have been able to grow my business into what it is today.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Cuts and camaraderie,” Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Having Winston’s next door has helped many people find my barber shop. Also, sometimes while waiting in line for a haircut customers will stop by Winston’s for something delicious to eat. We love being neighbors with them”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“We have people coming from Sonoma, Vallejo and sometimes even San Francisco”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Chateau Barber Shop celebrates decade of service,” Dec 15, 2015 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/chateau-barber-shop-celebrates-decade-of-service/article_26fc57db-4550-588f-8a20-742de348c257.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 122 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 145 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“People typically wait for the owner, but Andrea would always give a perfect cut, spending the time to pay close attention to detail. I like that a bald fade was truly a bald fade when coming here, some places arent willing to fully shave down to the skin when asked. This place was my go-to while living in the area and was always worth the drive for me. Miss coming here and will definitely go back when Im local.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San, is great with kids when I first started taking my son there he was two and a half He&#39;s 15 now Love this place super quick super professional and does a great job !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Adam W. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Mar 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“It is absolutely fabulous the owner&#39;s been cutting my hair for the past 15 years”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San has been doing my hair since I was young and I&#39;ve had 4 people ever doing my hair and she has done the best she is my favorite barber ever!and I totally recommend this barber shop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nikolas R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is an amazing barber always friendly and can get you feeling brand new. If you are having a bad day go get a haircut but keep the negativity at home. If busy you should wait it&#39;s worth it.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“There&#39;s a long line, it&#39;s cash only and they have $30 haircuts; kids 10 and under, and seniors 65 and older $25. San is skilled and did an excellent job quickly.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Wayne G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is amazing! I’ve been coming here for 10+ years. It’s First Come First Serve but she is efficient! After the first time I came she remembered my style. She’s the best. People wait for her for a reason.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San is the best in the business always delivers a fresh cut. Good prices Wait time not bad. Street parking and a parking lot. Downtown Napa.”</blockquote><figcaption>— John T. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“We found our new spot to take my 5 year old for an amazing, quick, friendly, and stylish cut! San was amazing with my son and he loved getting to pick his own lollipop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2020</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Dan citas?</summary><p>No, solo atendemos sin cita, por orden de llegada. A veces hay fila hasta afuera, pero creemos que vale la pena la espera.</p></details><details><summary>¿Solo aceptan efectivo?</summary><p>Sí, solo efectivo.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánto cuesta un corte?</summary><p>Un corte estándar cuesta unos $35, y los niños de 10 años o menos y los mayores de 65 pagan un precio reducido (alrededor de $25). Los precios pueden cambiar, así que llámanos al (707) 255-7662.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es el horario?</summary><p>Abrimos de martes a viernes de 9 AM a 6 PM y los sábados de 9 AM a 4 PM. Cerramos domingo y lunes.</p></details><details><summary>¿Dónde me estaciono?</summary><p>Hay estacionamiento en la calle y un lote cerca. Estamos en 1521 3rd St, en el centro de Napa.</p></details><details><summary>¿Desde cuándo está abierta la barbería?</summary><p>Abrí Chateau Barber Shop en junio de 2005 y celebramos 20 años el 1 de junio de 2025.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Visítanos</p>\n      <h2>Horario y ubicación</h2>\n      <address>1521 3rd St<br>Napa, CA 94559</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">(707) 255-7662</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>9 AM – 4 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Solo sin cita, no damos citas. Solo efectivo.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/the_chateau_barbershop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@the_chateau_barbershop</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/293242531597152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=